	(text_box "XT25F128FWOIGT-W\n\nSynopsis:\n\n	Serial NOR Flash Memory\n\n	3.3V Multi I/O with 4KB, 32KB & 64KB Sector/Block Erase\n\nDatasheet:\n\n	https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/lcsc_datasheet_2410121513_XTX-XT25F128FWOIGT-W_C3202839.pdf\n\nNotes:\n	1. IO0 and IO1 are used for Standard and Dual SPI instructions.\n	2. IO0 - IO3 are used for Quad SPI instructions, WP# & HOLD# (or RESET#) functions are only available for Standard/Dual SPI.\n\nDeep Power-Down Current: \n	typ 0.5 uA max 5 uA\n\nOperating currents:\n	Read: 20 mA max\n	Write: 25 mA max"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
